config BR2_TARGET_RUSTSBI
	bool "rustsbi"
	depends on BR2_riscv
	help
    RustSBI Prototyper is a developing RISC-V Secure Bootloader solution. 
    It can be integrated with the Rust or C language ecosystem to 
    form a complete RISC-V bootloader ecosystem.		

		https://github.com/openbouffalo/OBLFR


